  "title": "The BMI-HDEEG dataset 1",
  "description": "This dataset comprises high-density scalp EEG recordings collected during sensorimotor rhythm-based brain-computer interface (BCI) tasks. It was designed to support research into motor imagery decoding and neurofeedback training using EEG signals. The dataset accompanies a data descriptor published in Scientific Data, providing detailed EEG recordings for BCI-related sensorimotor rhythm analysis.",
